    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "note",
      "left": -300,
      "top": 490,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Custom behavioral components. IR inputs are scripted/manual, not a physical maze.\nSupply is ideal 5V; no battery/load physics. Motor display = normalized speed, not RPM.\nTRIG wire is a simulation-only probe of STBY. Click IR chip to select test mode.",
